#. 断る理由はないし…
#. 断る気持ちにもなれない…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's no reason to decline. And I'm not the type to\n"
"decline, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. 私も…あなたという人間に、
#. 興味を抱き始めているのかも…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Besides...I find myself more and more intrigued by\n"
"someone like you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんと一緒に過ごした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time with Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょうど喉が渇いたから、
#. 食堂で何か飲もうと思っていたところよ…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I was just about to head to the dining hall to get\n"
"something to drink."
msgstr ""

#. …あなたも一緒に来る？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Did you want to come with me?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんと一緒に、
#. 食堂でお茶を飲んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I went to the dining hall and drank some tea with\n"
"Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. たまには…気分転換も必要かもしれないわね…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I suppose a change of pace is necessary sometimes..."
msgstr ""

#. いいわ、少し休憩しましょうか。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Fine then, why don't we take a little break?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんと一緒に休憩した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time with Kyoko doing nothing in\n"
"particular...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …私と一緒にいたいの？
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...You want to spend time with me?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、私から話せる事なんてないわよ？
#. それでもいいの？
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But I don't have anything to say. Are you okay with\n"
"that?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無言の霧切さんと一緒に過ごした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time with Kyoko in silence...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Kyoko a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
